    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mandaat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "List with candidates for an election."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
