    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mandaat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The power to form or join a governing body for a certain period of time. A mandate may represent one or more seats."@en;
