    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mandaat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The regulations, legal act and/or policy choice which (temporarily) dismisses one or more mandates of a person starting from a specific date."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#LegalResource>, <http://purl.org/vocab/cpsv#FormalFramework>;
